{
    "_comment": "Wren in the Separated Village (until the Garden is open). A curious researcher: fast, precise, asks questions. Only a teaser here. Gives the first sigil (Overflow, 7.11) - also to players who talked to her before.",
    "partner": "wren",
    "start": [
        {
            "if": {
                "flag": "talked:wren",
                "not_flag": "wren_sigil"
            },
            "goto": "gift"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "flag": "talked:wren"
            },
            "goto": "again"
        },
        "first"
    ],
    "nodes": {
        "first": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "talked:wren"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "surprised",
                    "text": "Wait - you came from the Candy side? Through the forest?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Did the monsters there look... right to you?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Right?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Normal. Like monsters should look. I've been drawing them for years. They're changing. Every year a little stranger."
                },
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "More teeth. More eyes. Colours that don't belong to them. Nobody else sees it. Or nobody wants to."
                },
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "I'm Wren. If you go further - down, or up north - look at things. Really look."
                },
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "And then come tell me. Wherever I am."
                },
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Before you go - take this. I found it somewhere it shouldn't have been.",
                    "do": {
                        "sigil": "overflow",
                        "flag": "wren_sigil"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "What is it?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "No idea. It's warm. And it's not the only one - I've seen the same mark on old stones further on."
                },
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "If you find more, they're yours. Just tell me what they do."
                }
            ]
        },
        "again": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Still drawing. The new ones have too many teeth."
                },
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "North or down - either way, look carefully. Then tell me."
                },
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Did you see anything strange? Everything's strange. That's the problem."
                }
            ]
        },
        "gift": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "surprised",
                    "text": "Oh - it's you. Wait, I almost forgot."
                },
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Before you go - take this. I found it somewhere it shouldn't have been.",
                    "do": {
                        "sigil": "overflow",
                        "flag": "wren_sigil"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "What is it?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "No idea. It's warm. And it's not the only one - I've seen the same mark on old stones further on."
                },
                {
                    "who": "wren",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "If you find more, they're yours. Just tell me what they do."
                }
            ]
        }
    }
